<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - CARDICO STARTS TRADING.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - CARDICO STARTS TRADING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said new listing Cardico will make its trading debut on the bourse's small cap parallel market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The opening price will be 1,200 drachmas. Cardico has 3,032,700 outstanding common shares with a par value of 100 drachmas. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
